WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.000
ONE GO. Your business, in your hand.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.200
On your desktop, it lives inside ONE Brain, next to everything else.

00:09.700 --> 00:14.600
Every morning, ONE builds your list: who to call, text and visit.

00:15.100 --> 00:18.800
Tap call. Jen's birthday is tomorrow.

00:19.300 --> 00:23.000
Hang up, and it checks itself off.

00:23.500 --> 00:27.000
Same with a video text. Record, send, done.

00:27.500 --> 00:31.600
Everything else? Do the task, check the box.

00:32.100 --> 00:37.000
Time-block your day. Power Hour first. Protect your money time.

00:37.500 --> 00:41.600
Every business you trust, in one Rolodex.

00:42.100 --> 00:46.200
Refer one to a client with a single touch.

00:46.700 --> 00:51.200
Hot, warm and cold. Never miss a deal again.

00:51.700 --> 00:56.400
The drop-by map shows where your people are. Plan the route.

00:56.900 --> 01:01.400
In the Lounge, see what's working for other agents.

01:01.900 --> 01:06.400
Everything you do lights up ONE.

01:06.900 --> 01:11.000
Do the work. Win the week.

01:11.500 --> 01:16.200
ONE GO. Everything in the palm of your hand. Part of ONE.
